### What pa3ds calls Omega Ruby and Alpha Sapphire's pictures that the game never names, by the
### name of the picture's texture less `.bclim`. Said whole in place of the texture's own words,
### and ahead of the words every game shares (`data/common/en/pictures.ftl`).

# The opening's choice of boy or girl: a portrait each on the handheld's screen, `intro_male` and
# `intro_famale` (findings, spike 71). Read off the replays' pictures, enlarged
# (OR_character-desc.ctm as the boy, 2026-10-15, and OR_character-desc2.ctm as the girl,
# 2026-10-16); each one's clothes from the screen turning them round once chosen.
texture-intro_male = Menino, pele clara, cabelos castanhos, olhos azul-acinzentados, sorriso largo mostrando os dentes, gorro de malha preto com topo branco e emblema laranja na frente, camisa vermelha de manga curta com painéis pretos, mochila verde, calça preta
texture-intro_famale = Menina, pele clara com bochechas rosadas, cabelo castanho claro na altura dos ombros esvoaçante nas pontas, olhos azul-acinzentados, sorriso aberto, bandana vermelha com listras brancas amarrada em um grande laço no topo da cabeça, top vermelho sem mangas com gola preta, bolsa verde e amarela no quadril

